["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">干</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>干燥；晒干；干涉；退潮；干涸</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほ.す・ほ.し-・-ぼ.し・ひ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">干す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晾干；晒干；使干燥；沥干；排干；喝干；饮尽；使失去职位；剥夺工作机会</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">梅干</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うめぼし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">梅干；腌梅；盐渍梅干</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">干渉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干涉；介入；干预</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">虫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>虫；脾气；性情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ・キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">虫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昆虫；虫子；蟋蟀；蛾；蠕虫；蛔虫；影响思想感情的体内之物；潜意识；紧张；焦躁；专注于一事的人；执着的人；气门芯；（花札）虫（用减去部分牌的花札玩的一种牌戏）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">虫歯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むしば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蛀牙；龋齿；牙洞；龋病</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">昆虫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昆虫；虫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>印刷；刷子；刷；拓印</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.る・-ず.り・-ずり・は.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">印刷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刷る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">する</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷；印制；用木模印染布料；印花</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刷り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>热水；浴池；温泉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">热水；热浴；温泉；熔铁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒸汽；水蒸气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯飲み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆのみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">茶杯；茶盏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">溶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>溶解；融化；熔化</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.ける・と.かす・と.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span><span cla