读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">匹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小动物的计数词；布匹的计数词（两反为一匹）；马的计数词（古语）；布匹；布卷</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">匹敵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひってき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">匹敌；相当；等同；比得上</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">孫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>孙子；孙女；后代</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まご</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孙辈</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">子孫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しそん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">后代；子孙；后裔</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鋭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>尖锐；锋利；锐利；猛烈；敏锐</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">するど.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鋭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">するどい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">锋利的；尖锐的；（疼痛、声调等）剧烈的；尖锐的；（批评等）尖锐的；尖酸的；（攻击）猛烈的；（问题、目光等）犀利的；锐利的；（直觉、嗅觉等）敏锐的；灵敏的；（头脑等）敏锐的；机敏的；有洞察力的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">枝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\