\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">毒；毒物；毒液；危害；恶劣影响；恶意；怨恨；仇恨；辱骂性语言；恶言</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">気の毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きのどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可怜；不幸；悲惨；困苦；不可饶恕；遗憾；可惜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">消毒；灭菌；杀菌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">叫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>喊叫；呼喊；大声说</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さけ.ぶ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">叫ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さけぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大声喊叫；呼喊；尖叫；惊叫；呐喊；高呼；（对某事）大声疾呼；倡导；坚持主张；抗议；呼吁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">叫び</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さけび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">叫喊；喊声；呼喊；尖叫；惊叫；嚎叫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>参拜；礼拜；祈祷；崇拜；拜见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おが.む・おろが.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拝見</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（谦让语）