等）；侥幸夺得（意外之胜）；侥幸成功；接（人）；用车接送（某人）；招手拦（出租车）；打车；接收；捕捉（信号、声音、干扰等）；勉强回球；接回（难度大的球）；收留；雇用；给予工作机会；收容；步行；徒步</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">粉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>面粉；粉末；灰尘</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">デシメートル・こ・こな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粉；面粉；粉末；灰尘；海洛因</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">花粉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かふん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">花粉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粉々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こなごな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粉碎的；碎成粉末的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">糸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>线；丝；弦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">糸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">线；纱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">毛糸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">毛线；羊毛纱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">綿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>棉花；棉絮；细密；绵延</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">メン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">木綿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もめん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">棉；棉布；木棉树</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">綿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">棉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">汗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>汗；出汗</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あせ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あせ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">汗；汗液；湿气；凝结水；（表示尴尬或紧张）呃；哎呀</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">銅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>铜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あかがね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">銅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铜（化学元素Cu）；铜牌；铜质奖牌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>湿；湿润；潮湿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ・シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しめ.る・しめ.す・うるお.う・うるお.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\